{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19883","headline":"晚雪吟 · 孟郊","name":"晚雪吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫富喜雪晴，出门意皆饶。\n镜海见纤悉，冰天步飘颻。\n一一仙子行，家家尘声销。\n小儿击玉指，大耋歌圣朝。\n睿气流不尽，瑞仙何敻寥。\n始知望幸色，终疑异礼招。\n市井亦清洁，闾阎耸迢嶤。\n苍生愿东顾，翠华仍西遥。\n天念岂薄厚，宸衷多忧焦。\n忧焦致太平，以兹时比尧。\n古耳有未通，新词有潜韶。\n甘爲酒伶摈，坐耻歌女娇。\n选音不易言，裁正逢今朝。\n今朝前古文，律异同一调。\n愿於尧琯中，奏尽郁抑谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}